description:
Implement a hook that uses `ResizeObserver` to track the width and height of a DOM element. Returns `{ ref, width, height }` where dimensions update whenever the element is resized.

**Example:**
```tsx
function Box() {
  const { ref, width, height } = useResizeObserver();
  return <div ref={ref}>{width}x{height}</div>;
}
```

